### DRF Blog API Testing Suite
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### 1. Create an Author
POST {{baseUrl}}/authors/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Bhargava A",
    "bio": "Product Engineer at Zenovox",
    "email": "bhargava@example.com"
}

### 2. List Authors (with Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors/?search=Bhargava

### 3. Create a Post (Validation Failure Test - Title too short)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Hi",
    "content": "This should fail validation.",
    "author": 1
}

### 4. Create a Post (Success)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Agentic AI Orchestration",
    "content": "Exploring Gemini and GPT frameworks in modern architecture.",
    "author": 1,
    "is_published": true
}

### 5. Create a Comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "post": 1,
    "author_name": "Tech Reviewer",
    "body": "Great insights on multi-agent systems!"
}

### 6. Get All Posts (Demonstrating Nested Serializer & Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/

### 7. Filter Posts (Published only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/?is_published=true

### 8. Search Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/?search=Agentic

### 9. Update a Post (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Agentic AI Orchestration V2"
}

### 10. Delete a Post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/1/